== <script> ==
0000    1 OP_GET_GLOBAL       0 '@print'
0002    | OP_GET_GLOBAL       1 '@strConcat'
0004    | OP_CONSTANT         2 'kirby '
0006    | OP_GET_GLOBAL       3 '@version'
0008    | OP_CALL             0
0010    6 OP_CONSTANT         4 '

This is the Kirby language's Kirby project binary.

https://github.com/kirbylang/kirbylang
'
0012    1 OP_ARRAY            3
0014    | OP_CALL             1
0016    | OP_CALL             1
0018    | OP_POP
0019    7 OP_NIL
0020    | OP_RETURN
